
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sw">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <meta name="theme-color" content="#104b35">
  <meta name="description" content="Dhibiti taarifa zako binafsi kwenye ZUNE Account.">

  <title>Taarifa Binafsi | ZUNE</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --green: #104b35;
      --green-dark: #0b3526;
      --green-light: #e4f5eb;
      --orange: #f59e0b;
      --background: #f3f6f4;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #202b25;
      --muted: #748078;
      --border: #e1e8e3;
      --danger: #c62828;
      --success: #087443;
      --shadow: 0 5px 22px rgba(16, 75, 53, 0.06);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    button,
    input {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button,
    a {
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 15px 18px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .back-button {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      color: var(--green);
      background: var(--green-light);
      border-radius: 13px;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 39px;
      height: 39px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 800;
      border: 2px solid #d4eee0;
    }

    .brand-name {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .brand-caption {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 23px 16px 40px;
    }

    .page-heading {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 5px;
      color: var(--success);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .page-heading h1 {
      margin: 0 0 7px;
      color: var(--green-dark);
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .page-heading p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .profile-banner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      padding: 21px 18px;
      color: white;
      background: var(--green);
      border-radius: 23px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .avatar {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 62px;
      height: 62px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      color: var(--green);
      background: #d9f1e2;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .banner-details {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .banner-details h2 {
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      margin: 0 0 3px;
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .banner-details p {
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      margin: 0;
      color: #d6e8de;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .card {
      margin-bottom: 19px;
      padding: 22px 18px;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .card-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .heading-icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 43px;
      height: 43px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      color: var(--green);
      background: var(--green-light);
      border-radius: 13px;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .card-heading h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--green-dark);
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .card-heading p {
      margin: 3px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .field {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .field:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .field label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      color: #34483c;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .required {
      color: var(--danger);
    }

    .input-wrap {
      position: relative;
    }

    .field input {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 51px;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      color: var(--text);
      background: #fbfcfb;
      border: 1px solid #d9e3dc;
      border-radius: 12px;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    .field input:focus {
      background: white;
      border-color: var(--green);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(16, 75, 53, 0.09);
    }

    .field input[readonly] {
      color: #66736b;
      background: #f0f3f1;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .field small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .input-icon {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      right: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .info-note {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 13px;
      color: #355d46;
      background: #eef8f1;
      border: 1px solid #d7ebdd;
      border-radius: 13px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .info-note span:first-child {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .status-message {
      display: none;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .status-message.visible {
      display: block;
    }

    .status-message.success {
      color: #075b35;
      background: #e4f5eb;
      border: 1px solid #c5e8d1;
    }

    .status-message.error {
      color: #9d2020;
      background: #fff0f0;
      border: 1px solid #f3cccc;
    }

    .status-message.info {
      color: #31536d;
      background: #edf5fc;
      border: 1px solid #d4e7f6;
    }

    .actions {
      display: grid;
      gap: 11px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .button {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 9px;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 51px;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }

    .button:active {
      transform: scale(0.99);
    }

    .button:disabled {
      opacity: 0.65;
      cursor: wait;
    }

    .button-primary {
      color: white;
      background: var(--green);
    }

    .button-secondary {
      color: var(--green);
      background: var(--green-light);
      border: 1px solid #d0e9d9;
    }

    .button-text {
      color: var(--muted);
      background: transparent;
    }

    .account-id {
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      color: #53635a;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .bottom-note {
      padding: 10px 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .bottom-note a {
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    @media (min-width: 520px) {
      .page {
        padding-top: 32px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 27px 25px;
      }

      .profile-banner {
        padding: 25px;
      }

      .avatar {
        width: 75px;
        height: 75px;
        font-size: 32px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <a
      class="back-button"
      href="account.html"
      aria-label="Rudi kwenye akaunti"
    >‹</a>

    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-logo" aria-label="ZUNE">Z</div>
      <div>
        <p class="brand-name">ZUNE</p>
        <p class="brand-caption">Akaunti yako, taarifa zako</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="page">
    <section class="page-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Mipangilio ya akaunti</p>
      <h1>Taarifa Binafsi</h1>
      <p>
        Angalia na sasisha taarifa zako binafsi za ZUNE.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-banner" aria-label="Muhtasari wa akaunti">
      <div class="avatar" id="profileAvatar">Z</div>

      <div class="banner-details">
        <h2 id="bannerName">Inapakia akaunti...</h2>
        <p id="bannerEmail">Inasoma taarifa zako</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div
      id="pageMessage"
      class="status-message info visible"
      role="status"
      aria-live="polite"
    >
      Inajiandaa kupakia taarifa zako...
    </div>

    <form id="personalInfoForm" novalidate>
      <section class="card">
        <div class="card-heading">
          <div class="heading-icon" aria-hidden="true">♙</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Taarifa za msingi</h2>
            <p>Jina na mawasiliano yako</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="fullName">
            Jina kamili <span class="required">*</span>
          </label>

          <input
            type="text"
            id="fullName"
            name="fullName"
            placeholder="Andika jina lako kamili"
            autocomplete="name"
            maxlength="100"
            required
          >

          <small>Tumia jina unalotaka kuonekana nalo kwenye ZUNE.</small>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="email">Barua pepe</label>

          <input
            type="email"
            id="email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="Mfano: jina@example.com"
            autocomplete="email"
            readonly
            aria-describedby="emailHelp"
          >

          <small id="emailHelp">
            Email yako ya kuingia kwenye akaunti. Mabadiliko ya email
            yatahitaji utaratibu tofauti wa uthibitishaji.
          </small>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="phoneNumber">Namba ya simu</label>

          <input
            type="tel"
            id="phoneNumber"
            name="phoneNumber"
            placeholder="Mfano: 07XXXXXXXX au +255..."
            autocomplete="tel"
            inputmode="tel"
            maxlength="20"
          >

          <small>
            Weka namba yenye msimbo wa nchi ikiwa unautumia,
            kwa mfano +255.
          </small>
        </div>

        <div class="info-note">
          <span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span>
          <span>
            Taarifa zako zitaunganishwa na akaunti yako iliyopo.
            Usitume taarifa nyeti za siri kwenye sehemu hizi.
          </span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="card-heading">
          <div class="heading-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Kitambulisho cha ZUNE</h2>
            <p>Taarifa za utambulisho wa akaunti</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="zuneId">ZUNE ID</label>

          <input
            type="text"
            id="zuneId"
            name="zuneId"
            placeholder="Inapakia ZUNE ID..."
            readonly
          >

          <small>
            Kitambulisho hiki ni cha akaunti yako na hakiwezi
            kubadilishwa hapa.
          </small>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="accountRole">Aina ya akaunti</label>

          <input
            type="text"
            id="accountRole"
            name="accountRole"
            placeholder="Inapakia aina ya akaunti..."
            readonly
          >
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="actions">
        <button
          type="submit"
          id="saveButton"
          class="button button-primary"
        >
          <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span id="saveButtonText">Hifadhi Mabadiliko</span>
        </button>

        <button
          type="button"
          id="resetButton"
          class="button button-secondary"
        >
          Rejesha Taarifa Zilizohifadhiwa
        </button>

        <a
          class="button button-text"
          href="account.html"
        >
          Rudi kwenye Akaunti
        </a>
      </div>
    </form>

    <p class="bottom-note">
      Unahitaji msaada?
      <a href="account.html">Rudi kwenye ZUNE Account</a>
    </p>
  </main>

  <!-- JavaScript itaunganishwa hapa -->
  <script type="module" src="personal-info.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
